OL,3,GNEWSADJ Hannah Laing makes
OL,4,A'heartbreaking' decision to cancel 2027
OL,5,ADoof in the Park
OL,6,
OL,7,FDJ and producer Hannah Laing said she
OL,8,Fhas made the "heartbreaking" decision
OL,9,Fto cancel her Doof in the Park festival
OL,10,Fnext year.
OL,12,FLaing said "valuable planning time" had
OL,13,Fbeen lost due to "behind the scenes"
OL,14,Fissues that needed to be resolved.
OL,16,FShe said, as a result, her team did not
OL,17,Fhave enough time left to "deliver the
OL,18,Ffestival to the standard that you all
OL,19,Fknow from Doof."
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
